                  "This study inquired into the nature of identity among refugee
                  youth living at Dzaleka Refugee Camp in Malawi. Aged between
                  eighteen and twenty-four, the sample comprised of twenty-two
                  female and thirty-eight male participants, from Burundi, the
                  Democratic Republic of Congo, Rwanda, and Somalia."
